'''Gladion''' (Japanese: '''グラジオ''' ''Glazio'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Put 1 random {{TCGP|Type: Null}} or {{TCGP|Silvally}} from your deck into your hand.
}}

